+# End-of-season run: events still to run in 2026
+
+Notes for `agent-tasks/sessions-queue.md` (Phase A). Tick the items marked done there.
+Every time below was converted with `node scripts/tz.mjs`; every patch passed the dry run and was applied with `--write`.
+
+## Done (official source, patch in this folder)
+
+| Queue item | Result | Source |
+|---|---|---|
+| f1 · Las Vegas GP | 5 sessions. `time` and `date` were already right. | formula1.com Las Vegas GP timetable |
+| f1a · Rd 7: Las Vegas (Finale) | 4 sessions. `time`/`date` corrected by hand: the 00:00 was a placeholder. Races are SAT 03:15 and SUN 01:20 Paris; `date` is now the second race. | formula1.com Las Vegas GP timetable |
+| sf · Suzuka II | 4 sessions. `time`/`date` corrected by hand: it is a double-header, Round 11 SAT 06:25 and Round 12 SUN 05:50 Paris (was one race at 05:00, dated 06:00). | suzukacircuit.jp timetable, "as of November 7" |
+| f1 · Qatar GP | 5 sessions, F2 feature race SUN 13:00. `time` and `date` were already right. | formula1.com Qatar GP timetable |
+| f1 · Abu Dhabi GP | 5 sessions, F2 feature race SUN 10:15, all `provisional` (the page says "subject to change"). `time` and `date` were already right. | formula1.com Abu Dhabi GP timetable |
+| supercars · bp Adelaide Grand Final | **Wrong weekend in the calendar.** The event is 26–29 November, not 3–6 December. Moved from week 49 to week 48, three races (FRI 06:50, SAT 05:50, SUN 05:45 Paris), `start`/`end` added, 10 sessions. | supercars.com event page and track-schedule article (times "correct as of October 21") |
+
+F2 `detail` at Qatar and Abu Dhabi was edited by hand to name the sprint (SAT 17:15 and SAT 13:15 Paris) next to the feature-race chip.
+
+## Checked, nothing to change
+
+| Queue item | Finding |
+|---|---|
+| motogp · Portuguese Grand Prix | Race is 13:00 local on 22 November, which is 14:00 Paris: the calendar is right. No sessions added: motogp.com shows no timetable in a form that can be read, and the only timetables found are on news sites (not an allowed source). |
+| motogp · Valencian Community GP (Finale) | Race 14:00 Paris on 29 November per two news-site calendars: the calendar matches. Same block as above for sessions. Other MotoGP classes are still not `sub` rows. |
+
+## Blocked (no allowed source)
+
+| Queue item | Finding |
+|---|---|
+| tcr · Macau (Season Finale) | The calendar says R1 05:15, R2 09:00, dated 08:00, and is very likely wrong. A Hong Kong newspaper (stheadline.com, 10 November) prints the full Macau GP programme: TCR Race 1 Saturday 21 November 13:20 and Race 2 Sunday 22 November 11:00 Macau time, which is SAT 06:20 and SUN 04:00 Paris. The official programme (macau.grandprix.gov.mo) and the TCR timetable PDF could not be read, so nothing was changed. Needs Yann's call or a look at the official programme. |
+| eurx · World Cup: Jakarta | 5–6 December is confirmed. No timetable published. Note: every source describes it as a standalone, non-championship event, so it is not a round of the European championship. |
+
+## Not done
+
+- supercars · Penrite Oil Sandown 500 and asian-le-mans · Rounds 1–2: Paul Ricard had already run or were running when this was done.
